      "created_at": "2016-10-04T18:32:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The last update was on 9/19 from the KS&nbsp;https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/handelabra/sentinels-of-the-multiverse-the-video-game-season/posts/1685292</p><blockquote><p>&nbsp;</p><div><h1>Super-Scientific Shipping</h1><p>Now that Season 2 has begun, we’ve shifted our attention to building Vengeance and fulfilling the rest of the items ordered via the Kickstarter and BackerKit. The only physically shipping item is The Super-Scientific Tachyon variant card.</p><p><b>If you are receiving a Tachyon card and need to update your shipping address in BackerKit, you now have 48 hours to do so.</b></p><p>Regular variant cards will be shipped directly from Greater Than Games. The collectors cards have been signed and sealed, and the package is now on its way to Greater Than Games HQ where they will be packaged and shipped to you. We’ll keep you posted in the coming week or so!&nbsp;</p></div></blockquote><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
