      "created_at": "2016-10-05T19:27:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This is the latest KS update:</p><blockquote><h1>Tachyon Shipping Update</h1><p>All the Tachyon cards (signed and not) are at the Greater Than Games warehouse and have been added to their shipping queue. We’re assured that shipping should be commencing on those shortly so thanks for your patience, you should all start receiving your cards soon! The cards will be sent out via regular post and will not have tracking. Please be patient and allow several weeks for shipping before contacting us about your card.</p></blockquote>",
